{"parse":{"title":"个性/微光巡行","pageid":8952,"revid":21999,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%BE%AE%E5%85%89%E5%B7%A1%E8%A1%8C&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%BE%AE%E5%85%89%E5%B7%A1%E8%A1%8C&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E5%BE%AE%E5%85%89%E5%B7%A1%E8%A1%8C&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>微光巡行</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.BE.AE.E5.85.89.E5.B7.A1.E8.A1.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"微光巡行\"><b>微光巡行</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 微光巡行.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/lrclvpib4d6zni8dh9x15tpe0t6gp3v.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%BE%AE%E5%85%89%E5%B7%A1%E8%A1%8C.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/lrclvpib4d6zni8dh9x15tpe0t6gp3v.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E5%BE%AE%E5%85%89%E5%B7%A1%E8%A1%8C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/23/lrclvpib4d6zni8dh9x15tpe0t6gp3v.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />微光巡行\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有光环：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光辉使者\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光辉使者</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]为正时：攻击时拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿甲\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿甲</font></span></span>]，且每点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]使最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，效果最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，若自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]为负，还原为<font color=\"#ed7950\">0</font>。<br />✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤巡光使</font></span>]。克莱雅自身总视为被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"巡光使\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">巡光使</font></span></span>]环绕，满足条件时可触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"公正审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">公正审判</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。<br />✦拥有光环：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣光普照\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣光普照</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%8B%E8%8E%B1%E9%9B%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/克莱雅\"><img alt=\"头像 克莱雅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/39/m6bx0441s4s8q5e916ymnk12ht6o8yu.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">克莱雅</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有光环：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光辉使者\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光辉使者</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]为正时：攻击时拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿甲\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿甲</font></span></span>]，且每点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]使最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，效果最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，若自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]为负，还原为<font color=\"#ed7950\">0</font>。<br />✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">召唤巡光使</font></span>]。克莱雅自身总视为被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"巡光使\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">巡光使</font></span></span>]环绕，满足条件时可触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"公正审判\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">公正审判</font></span></span>]。<br />✦攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦拥有光环：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"圣光普照\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">圣光普照</font></span></span>]。<br />✦被[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"巡光使\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">巡光使</font></span></span>]环绕的已方，行动开始时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲移动1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲移动1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有光环：[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"光辉使者\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">光辉使者</font></span></span>]。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]为正时：攻击时拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿甲\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿甲</font></span></span>]，且每点[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]使最终伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，最终受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">1%</font>，效果最多<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，若自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"虔诚值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">虔诚值</font></span></span>]为负，还原为<font color=\"#ed7950\">0</font>。<br />✦拥有技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\